flowchart TB
  accTitle: Create, detach, and reattach a tmux session
  accDescr: Create a train session on the server and run a task. Detaching leaves the task running. Reconnect over SSH and attach to the same session to inspect its progress.

connect["Connect to the server<br/>Open an SSH terminal"]
  create["Create a named session<br/>tmux new -s train"]
  run["Start the task inside the session<br/>python train.py"]
  detach["Detach from the session<br/>Ctrl+B, release, then D"]
  background["Return to the regular terminal<br/>The task keeps running on the server"]
  return["Check progress later<br/>Reconnect over SSH"]
  attach["Reattach to the existing session<br/>tmux attach -t train"]
  inspect["View live output<br/>Interact with the task again"]
  connect --> create --> run --> detach --> background
  background --> return --> attach --> inspect
  inspect -->|"When you need to leave"| detach
